==German==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|scōn}}, {{m|gmh|scōne||beautifully, appropriately, completely}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|scōno||beautifully}}; cognate with {{m|de|schön||beautiful}}.<ref>[[w:Friedrich Kluge|Kluge, Friedrich]] (1975). ''Etymologisches Wörterbuch der deutschen Sprache''. 21st edition. Berlin: Walter de Gruyter. p.&nbsp;675.</ref>

